During the [[Imperial Era]], a '''desert town''' was located on [[Unidentified astronomical object (Cort)|an astronomical object]] that was occupied by the [[Galactic Empire]]. It was called home by [[Cort]], a [[human]] [[Gender|woman]] who ran a [[Cort's transport office|transport office]] near the town's [[spaceport]]. The former [[Sith acolyte]] [[Asajj Ventress]], who was employed by Cort, also lived in the town into she forsook her quiet life to help the [[Youngling|young]] [[Jedi]] [[Lyco Strata]] escape the Imperial forces who were [[Hunt for Lyco Strata|pursuing]] him.<ref name="TOTU 101" />

